      "text": "The others lead to terminal non-spaces.",
      "start": 8.031183925599327,
      "end": 10.904726798061471,
      "scene_id": "hook_01_three_doors"
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose your door before the lockdown seals permanently.",
      "start": 10.904726798061471,
      "end": 14.95715905409783,
      "scene_id": "hook_01_three_doors"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you choose Door Number One",
      "start": 15.45715905409783,
      "end": 17.400060641009127,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "you step into Level Thirty-Seven",
      "start": 17.400060641009127,
      "end": 19.543952047256077,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "commonly known as The Poolrooms.",
      "start": 19.543952047256077,
      "end": 21.687843453503028,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "The heavy iron door slams shut",
      "start": 21.687843453503028,
      "end": 23.697741646859544,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the latch dissolves into solid ceramic.",
      "start": 23.697741646859544,
      "end": 26.578595724003883,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "The air is humid and smells faintly of chlorinated bleach.",
      "start": 26.928595724003884,
      "end": 31.097949248913295,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "Acoustic echoes here are dilated.",
      "start": 31.097949248913295,
      "end": 33.470167633775546,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "Footsteps echo for up to twenty seconds",
      "start": 33.470167633775546,
      "end": 36.273698452249114,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "masking the sound of approaching entities.",
      "start": 36.273698452249114,
      "end": 39.292885487528345,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "For hydration",
      "start": 39.64288548752834,
      "end": 40.565863112313195,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "do not drink the standing pool water",
      "start": 40.565863112313195,
      "end": 43.121801150178946,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "as it causes severe cellular dehydration.",
      "start": 43.121801150178946,
      "end": 46.03273058219271,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead, collect the fresh condensation dripping from overhead copper pipes.",
      "start": 46.03273058219271,
      "end": 51.428599773242624,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid the darker deep-end tunnels.",
      "start": 51.778599773242625,
      "end": 54.07568803529904,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "Submerged drain currents harbor shadow ripple anomalies that pull",
      "start": 54.07568803529904,
      "end": 58.467180300995125,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "survivors beneath the tiled floors without leaving a wake.",
      "start": 58.467180300995125,
      "end": 62.38574263038548,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stay on the elevated dry walkways.",
      "start": 62.73574263038548,
      "end": 64.78899011985746,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "Walk toward the hum of the filtration",
      "start": 64.78899011985746,
      "end": 67.02340650545932,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "pumps until you reach the maintenance stairwell.",
      "start": 67.02340650545932,
      "end": 69.92210884353742,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your twenty-four hour survival probability is seventy-eight percent.",
      "start": 69.92210884353742,
      "end": 74.02860382248137,
      "scene_id": "opt1_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you open Door Number Two, you enter",
      "start": 74.82860382248137,
      "end": 77.24930457767817,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "an abandoned multi-tier shopping atrium frozen in nineteen eighty-six.",
      "start": 77.24930457767817,
      "end": 81.70849017935649,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "The air smells of old carpet and ozone.",
      "start": 81.70849017935649,
      "end": 84.19289358600584,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "An endless distorted elevator muzak plays from crackling PA speakers.",
      "start": 84.54289358600583,
      "end": 89.6924009751684,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prolonged exposure causes rapid short-term memory loss within forty minutes.",
      "start": 89.6924009751684,
      "end": 95.3643221574344,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "For sustenance, search the food court stockrooms",
      "start": 95.7143221574344,
      "end": 98.79313719255678,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "for intact hermetically sealed steel canned goods.",
      "start": 98.79313719255678,
      "end": 102.00023618747593,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Never touch open beverage dispensers or warm sodas.",
      "start": 102.00023618747593,
      "end": 105.27147716229348,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beware the store mannequins.",
      "start": 105.62147716229347,
      "end": 107.39147787091025,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "They only relocate when unobserved.",
      "start": 107.39147787091025,
      "end": 109.60397875668123,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you turn a corner and notice a",
      "start": 109.60397875668123,
      "end": 111.69005102040815,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "mannequin facing toward you, immediately retrace your footsteps.",
      "start": 111.69005102040815,
      "end": 115.73576692581793,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover your ears with cloth to mitigate the audio hazard",
      "start": 116.08576692581794,
      "end": 119.80173724251604,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "stay away from reflective store glass",
      "start": 119.80173724251604,
      "end": 122.30157181920386,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "and reach the loading bay before midnight.",
      "start": 122.30157181920386,
      "end": 125.13922187922786,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "Survival rate is thirty-one percent.",
      "start": 125.13922187922786,
      "end": 127.57149335924844,
      "scene_id": "opt2_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "Door Number Three leads straight down into Sector Zero.",
      "start": 128.37149335924846,
      "end": 132.20010968884594,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "The heavy airlock seals automatically, locking you into",
      "start": 132.20010968884594,
      "end": 136.02872601844342,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "a subterranean network bathed in crimson emergency strobes.",
      "start": 136.02872601844342,
      "end": 140.13578717201165,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc1_entry"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ambient temperature exceeds one hundred and ten degrees.",
      "start": 140.48578717201167,
      "end": 144.33504817352008,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "High pressure steam pipes periodically rupture without warning",
      "start": 144.33504817352008,
      "end": 148.31261787507876,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "causing instantaneous third-degree burns.",
      "start": 148.31261787507876,
      "end": 150.9429462261095,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc2_environment"
    },
    {
      "text": "You will spot green emergency",
      "start": 151.2929462261095,
      "end": 153.27508908325237,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "ration crates placed conveniently in junctions.",
      "start": 153.27508908325237,
      "end": 156.4875275068977,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not touch them.",
      "start": 156.4875275068977,
      "end": 157.71782307340015,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "These are mimic bait deployed by",
      "start": 157.71782307340015,
      "end": 159.90501519162675,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "indigenous predators to trap starving survivors.",
      "start": 159.90501519162675,
      "end": 163.18580336896665,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc3_rations"
    },
    {
      "text": "The primary entity in Sector Zero mimics the",
      "start": 163.53580336896664,
      "end": 166.69818136364276,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "desperate voices of your relatives calling for help.",
      "start": 166.69818136364276,
      "end": 170.43553717553274,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "It navigates entirely by flashlight beams and acoustic resonance.",
      "start": 170.43553717553274,
      "end": 175.10723194039522,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc4_entities"
    },
    {
      "text": "The moment the background klaxon siren ceases, you must immediately",
      "start": 175.45723194039522,
      "end": 180.03829397047042,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "extinguish all light sources and drop flat against the grating.",
      "start": 180.03829397047042,
      "end": 184.3458597599441,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "Any movement is fatal.",
      "start": 184.3458597599441,
      "end": 185.85008908325236,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc5_protocol"
    },
    {
      "text": "No documented explorer has ever",
      "start": 186.20008908325235,
      "end": 188.3017203581516,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc6_verdict"
    },
    {
      "text": "reached the surface from Sector Zero.",
      "start": 188.3017203581516,
      "end": 190.81011897657976,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc6_verdict"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your calculated twenty-four hour survival rate",
      "start": 190.81011897657976,
      "end": 193.92866861030126,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc6_verdict"
    },
    {
      "text": "is zero point zero one percent.",
      "start": 193.92866861030126,
      "end": 196.03029988520052,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc6_verdict"
    },
    {
      "text": "Which door did you choose?",
      "start": 196.03029988520052,
      "end": 197.7929583738257,
      "scene_id": "opt3_sc6_verdict"
    }
  ],
  "duration": 198.95410430839001
}